  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I migrated my project from legacy SDK3 avatars to a VCC project and started seeing this error. It appears to be because the old SDK folder was not deleted / omitted from the migrated project. \n\nVRCSDK - Base is version 3.1.10\n\nVRCSDK - Avatars is version 3.1.10\n\nUnity editor is version 2019.4.31f1\n\nProject was recently migrated (Saturday January 28th) with the then-latest version of VCC. The VCC initially misidentified it as a Worlds project, so I subsequently removed the Worlds SDK package and then added the Avatars SDK package -- not sure if that affects this.",
